derived-formula-vorticity = ω = curl u
derived-formula-q-criterion = Q = ½ (‖Ω‖² − ‖S‖²), vortices where Q > 0
derived-formula-lambda2 = λ₂ of S² + Ω², vortices where λ₂ < 0
derived-formula-total-pressure = p + ½ ρ u·u
derived-formula-pressure-coefficient = (p − p_ref) / (½ ρ_ref U_ref²)
derived-formula-enstrophy = ½ ω·ω
derived-formula-strain-rate = √(2 S:S), the shear rate
derived-formula-relative-velocity = w = c − Ω × (x − x0), seen from the turning zone
derived-formula-frame-velocity = u = Ω × (x − x0), the blade speed
derived-formula-velocity-radial = c_r, away from the axis
derived-formula-velocity-circumferential = c_u, positive with the rotation
derived-formula-velocity-axial = c_a, along Ω
derived-formula-velocity-meridional = c_m = √(c_r² + c_a²)
derived-formula-relative-velocity-circumferential = w_u = c_u − u_u
derived-formula-flow-angle = α = atan2(c_m, c_u), from the circumferential direction
derived-formula-relative-flow-angle = β = atan2(c_m, −w_u), 90° without relative swirl
derived-formula-relative-total-pressure = p + ½ ρ w·w
derived-formula-rothalpy = I = p/ρ + ½ w·w − ½ u·u, constant along a lossless relative streamline
derived-formula-dissipation-rate = ε = C_μ k ω (from ω), else ε itself
derived-formula-specific-dissipation-rate = ω = ε / (C_μ k) (from ε), else ω itself
derived-formula-time-scale = T = k/ε = 1/(C_μ ω)
derived-formula-length-scale = L = k^1.5 / ε
derived-formula-viscosity-ratio = ν_t / ν
derived-formula-reynolds-stress-xx = 2/3 k − 2 ν_t S_xx (Boussinesq)
derived-formula-reynolds-stress-yy = 2/3 k − 2 ν_t S_yy (Boussinesq)
derived-formula-reynolds-stress-zz = 2/3 k − 2 ν_t S_zz (Boussinesq)
derived-formula-reynolds-stress-xy = −2 ν_t S_xy (Boussinesq)
derived-formula-reynolds-stress-yz = −2 ν_t S_yz (Boussinesq)
